const APC=[{"b":"Root","nv":"Coccygeal / Sacral Plexus (S4-Co1)","d":"Survival charge encodes in the coccygeal and sacral plexus because the body's primary question, am I safe?, routes through the lowest nerve roots. Scarcity, physical harm, and tribal rejection all converge here. Highest embodiment ratio in the system (27.7%). This layer is actively transitioning.","sub":[["Survival Fear",193,93],["Physical Body",114,2],["Financial Scarcity",82,0],["Tribal / Family",63,1],["Shelter / Stability",18,34]]},{"b":"Sacral","nv":"Sacral Plexus (S1-S3) / Hypogastric","d":"Creativity and desire encode in the sacral plexus because these are the body's generative functions at the nerve level. Suppressed creativity is a sacral nerve charge. The S1-S3 roots fire every time creative expression is blocked. Lowest embodiment ratio (2.6%). The creative suppression charge runs deeper than any other layer. The installation of coherent opposites has barely begun.","sub":[["Creativity Suppression",211,7],["Emotional Flow",197,5],["Pleasure / Guilt",135,1],["Sexual Identity",64,1],["Relationships / Intimacy",13,2]]},{"b":"Solar","nv":"Solar / Celiac Plexus (T5-T12)","d":"The celiac plexus is the most complex autonomic network outside the brain. Power, self-worth, shame, and will all encode here because this is where the body processes its relationship to the external world. The felt sense of \"can I handle this?\" is a celiac plexus response. 31.9% of total pattern load. Every major saboteur structure in the catalog has a Solar Plexus root node.","sub":[["Self-Worth / Inadequacy",366,56],["Willpower / Giving Up",330,1],["Power / Powerlessness",124,16],["Control / Chaos",118,6],["Anger / Rage",111,1],["Shame / Humiliation",92,1],["Responsibility Avoidance",68,5]]},{"b":"Heart","nv":"Cardiac Plexus / Vagus (T1-T4)","d":"The cardiac plexus receives vagal branches carrying relational information upward from the gut. Grief, love, abandonment, and forgiveness encode here because the heart conducts the information of relational experience through its nerve branches. 14.6% embodiment, the highest rate among the major clusters. When heart patterns clear, coherent opposites install effectively.","sub":[["Love / Fear of Love",122,11],["Forgiveness",84,7],["Connection / Isolation",25,16],["Abandonment / Rejection",23,2],["Grief / Loss",14,3]]},{"b":"Throat","nv":"Pharyngeal / Cervical Plexus (C1-C4)","d":"The cervical plexus innervates the structures of vocalization. Voice suppression is a cervical nerve charge, a literal nerve-level tightening around the mechanisms of speech every time the person was silenced, shamed for speaking, or punished for having a voice. 405 of 604 Throat patterns are Voice Suppression alone. The charge is not about confidence as a concept. It is about C1-C4 nerve roots firing at the moment of self-expression.","sub":[["Voice Suppression",405,5],["Self-Expression Blocks",38,26],["Public Speaking / Visibility",32,6],["Judgement Fear",17,0]]},{"b":"3rd Eye","nv":"Optic / Trigeminal / Cranial Nerves (CN II, V)","d":"The trigeminal nerve is the largest cranial nerve, with connections into the optic pathways. Decision paralysis and unclear direction are not thinking problems. They are trigeminal and optic nerve charges that fire when the person is about to commit to a direction. Vision/Direction carries 123 patterns, the dominant subcategory. The charge that keeps a person from seeing their next step has a specific cranial nerve address.","sub":[["Vision / Direction",123,9],["Perception / Reality",69,1],["Decision Paralysis",23,6],["Intuition Denial",17,2],["Overthinking / Mental Loops",9,0]]},{"b":"Crown","nv":"Pineal / Reticular Formation / Cranial Convergence","d":"\"I AM\" constructions encode at the crown because this is the convergence point of all cranial nerve inputs. Every belief about self, every self-limiting story, routes through the pineal and reticular formation. The crown is not a spiritual location. It is a nerve topology. 196 Identity/I Am patterns. Each one is a self-limiting I AM construction running as a retrieval command at the nerve level.","sub":[["Identity / I Am",196,17],["Existential Despair",106,9],["God / Source",56,1],["Surrender / Trust",14,4],["Purpose / Mission",14,0],["Ascension / Awakening",2,1]]}];
